    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This Is A Short Game</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Steam Deck supported</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891650/extras/ceafec69ff8154db44d285662a29cfcc.poster.avif?t=1737814006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891650/extras/ceafec69ff8154db44d285662a29cfcc.webm?t=1737814006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891650/extras/ceafec69ff8154db44d285662a29cfcc.mp4?t=1737814006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Love In the Shadows</h2>Experience an emotional rollercoaster as you assume the role of a monster, navigating in search of glimpses of the human girl who has stolen your monstrous heart.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stealth Is Key</h2>Embrace the art of stealth as you move through the shadows, avoiding detection at all costs.The stakes are high \u2013 if you're caught, it's not just your life on the line, but the delicate heart of the human girl as well.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Heartfelt Connection</h2>Your survival is intricately tied to the well-being of the human girl. If she catches sight of you, her heart may not withstand the shock, leading to dire consequences. Conversely, if you lose sight of her, the overwhelming sadness may prove fatal for your monstrous existence.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This Is A Short Game</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Steam Deck supported</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891650/extras/ceafec69ff8154db44d285662a29cfcc.poster.avif?t=1737814006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891650/extras/ceafec69ff8154db44d285662a29cfcc.webm?t=1737814006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891650/extras/ceafec69ff8154db44d285662a29cfcc.mp4?t=1737814006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Love In the Shadows</h2>Experience an emotional rollercoaster as you assume the role of a monster, navigating in search of glimpses of the human girl who has stolen your monstrous heart.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stealth Is Key</h2>Embrace the art of stealth as you move through the shadows, avoiding detection at all costs.The stakes are high \u2013 if you're caught, it's not just your life on the line, but the delicate heart of the human girl as well.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Heartfelt Connection</h2>Your survival is intricately tied to the well-being of the human girl. If she catches sight of you, her heart may not withstand the shock, leading to dire consequences. Conversely, if you lose sight of her, the overwhelming sadness may prove fatal for your monstrous existence.",
